     3842   ON LEAVE OF varbase-rate IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     3843   DO:
     3844     if input frame Dialog-Frame varbase-rate <> round (varbase-rate, 4) then do:
     3845       assign
     3846         frame Dialog-Frame
     3847         varbase-rate.
     3848     end.
     3849   END.
     3850   ON return OF varbase-rate IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     3851   DO:
     3852       return no-apply.
     3853   END.
     3854   ON LEAVE OF varbase-scale IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     3855   DO:
     3856     if input frame Dialog-Frame varbase-scale <> varbase-scale then do:
     3857       assign
     3858         frame Dialog-Frame
     3859         varbase-scale.
     3860     end.
     3861   END.
