     5252                     error-status:get-message(1)
     5253       view-as alert-box.
     5254       assign
     5255         varvat-pc = varmem-vat-pc.
     5256       display varvat-pc with frame Dialog-Frame.
     5257     end.
     5258   end.
     5259   END.
