     5462     ,output vartemp-scale
     5463     ,output varcur-cli-name
     5464     )  .
     5465     display varcur-base-name varcur-cli-name with frame Dialog-Frame.
     5466     run tax-name in this-procedure ('rdt':U, output vartitle-road-tax) no-error.
     5467     if error-status:error then do:
